   an empty line before the request                     200  1x  GET /user HTTP/1.1
   TRACE                                                200  1x  TRACE /user HTTP/1.1
   CONNECT                                              200  1x  CONNECT /user HTTP/1.1
   another Host than the connection's                   502  1x  GET /user HTTP/1.1
   Host with another port                               200  1x  GET /user HTTP/1.1
   Host with a user in front                            200  1x  GET /user HTTP/1.1
